title: room.enter
---
<<music stop>>
<<if not $reachedStair>>
The stair drops away below us, past the reach of the lantern. #line:103-001
Watson: Holmes. Listen. #line:103-002
<<sound 133 wait>>
<<wait 0.6>>
<<sound 133 wait>>
<<wait 0.6>>
<<sound 133 wait>>
Somewhere below, a single clock is ticking. #line:103-003
Hero: Then someone down there is still keeping time. #line:103-004
<<set $reachedStair to true>>
<<wait 1.5>>
<<room 105>>
<<endif>>
===

title: room.look
---
Bare boards, then steps going down into the dark. Older than the shop around them. #line:103-005
===

title: stairs.look
---
I cannot see the bottom. Only the ticking comes up out of the dark. #line:103-006
===

title: stairs.do
---
Hero: Not yet, Watson. Let us learn who is down there before they learn we are here. #line:103-007
===

title: entranceDoor.look
---
The door we came through. On the other side, Thorne's clock stands open. #line:103-009
===

title: watson.talk
---
Watson: I'll be right behind you. #line:103-008
===
